    "updated_at": "2021-07-28T08:04:07Z",
    "body": "> we can't give document's language without html element.\r\n\r\nThat's not correct. You can specify language also on the server level (HTTP header), on elements other than <code>html</code>, as well as through metadata.\r\n\r\n(I’d also submit that [declaring language is optional](https://meiert.com/en/blog/lang/) and should not be _required_ anymore, but that’s not a conversation to be had here.)",
